UPDATE companies SET description='E-J Industries has operated from Chicago, Illinois since 1942. The company began as a family enterprise and remains under the stewardship of third-generation owner Keith Weitzman, who learned the trade from his father Leonard on the factory floor.

The 150,000-square-foot facility houses engineers, carpenters, and upholstery specialists who produce custom banquette seating, architectural millwork, and upholstered pieces from initial sketch through installation. The shop also tackles one-off showcase projects such as a 30-foot wooden guitar or a bar wall built from whiskey barrels.

The firm''s client base centers on the restaurant and hospitality sectors, supplying high-end restaurants, hotels, and other commercial interiors with seating and millwork tailored to each venue''s layout and brand. Projects range from standard booth runs to fully bespoke architectural elements for luxury environments.

E-J Industries emphasizes early collaboration, positioning itself as a partner that reviews designs for manufacturability and suggests improvements before production begins. The company cites its hand-drawn, hand-made, hand-delivered approach and the continuity of family leadership as the foundation of its consistency and quality.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Banquette seating", "Architectural millwork", "Upholstery", "Reupholstery", "Design consultation", "Custom fabrication", "Showcase specialty projects", "Installation services"], "industries": ["Restaurant", "Hospitality", "Hotel"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1942 -> /", "Headquarters in Chicago, Illinois -> /", "Family-owned, three-generation leadership (Keith Weitzman, Leonard, Jason) -> /about", "150,000 sq ft facility with engineers, carpenters, office staff -> /about", "Custom banquette seating, millwork, upholstery, reupholstery -> /capabilities", "Serves restaurant and hospitality industries -> /", "In-house upholstery with overnight reupholstery service -> /capabilities", "Hand-drawn, hand-made, hand-delivered millwork -> /capabilities", "No catalog, custom to design specs -> /capabilities", "Showcase specialty projects (e.g., 30-foot wooden guitar) -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "At E-J Industries, we''ve been building custom booths, fixed seating, millwork and more since 1942.", "founded_year": "1942", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='e-j-industries-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
