UPDATE companies SET description='ECG Solar is based in Anamosa, Iowa, just outside Cedar Rapids, and has been installing solar panel systems since 2008. The company operates as a solar installation and energy services provider serving customers throughout the state.

The firm delivers turnkey solar and energy storage solutions that include photovoltaic (PV) and AC-coupled PV panel systems, Enphase solar battery storage, Kohler standby generators, and EV chargers. Installations are performed by certified employees using what the company describes as state-of-the-art equipment, with services covering residential, commercial, and municipal projects across Iowa.

ECG Solar works with homeowners, businesses, and public-sector clients. A noted municipal reference is the City of Maysville Fire Department, which appears among the company''s project portfolio. The company also provides tax credit resources and energy efficiency consulting as part of its service offering.

The company distinguishes itself as the only authorized and certified Kohler dealer and service provider in Eastern Iowa, and it emphasizes its use of Tier 1 photovoltaic panels and Enphase battery systems. Its positioning centers on cost-effective, turnkey delivery backed by a certified installation team and long-term workmanship warranties.', certifications=ARRAY['Authorized Kohler dealer and service provider']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation (PV and ACPV)", "Solar battery storage installation (Enphase)", "Backup generator installation and service (Kohler)", "EV charger installation", "Energy efficiency consulting", "Tax credit resource assistance"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Municipal / Government"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Kohler standby generators", "Enphase solar battery storage systems", "Tier 1 photovoltaic panels", "ACPV systems"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only authorized and certified Kohler dealer and service provider in Eastern Iowa", "Installs Enphase solar battery storage systems", "Turnkey solar and energy storage solutions with certified employees", "Tier 1 photovoltaic and AC-coupled PV panel installations"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2008 -> db", "Headquarters Anamosa, Iowa -> db", "Solar installation company based outside Cedar Rapids -> /", "Only authorized and certified Kohler dealer in Eastern Iowa -> /", "Installs Enphase solar battery storage systems -> /", "Offers Tier 1 PV panels and ACPV systems -> /", "Provides EV chargers -> /", "Turnkey solutions with certified employees -> /", "Projects include City of Maysville Fire Department -> /", "Services residential, commercial, municipal clients -> /", "Offers tax credit resources -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "ECG Solar\u2122 is a solar installation company based outside of Cedar Rapids that offers a range of products to help clients thr