UPDATE companies SET description='Eagle Automotive Distributors operates as part of the Lowe Automotive Group, headquartered in St. Louis, Missouri. The business traces its roots to 1968 when Norman Lowe established the company; after his passing in 1996, his son Jeff Lowe assumed the presidency of Lowe Automotive Whse. and MAP Automotive Whse. The group has grown through a series of expansions and acquisitions across Missouri, Illinois, and Wisconsin.

