UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Triadelphia, West Virginia, East Coast Metal Systems, Inc. (ECMS) has spent decades providing full-service fabrication for engineered architectural metal and exterior envelope systems. The company operates a 60,000-square-foot facility that supports extensive customization for projects nationwide.

