UPDATE companies SET description='East Coast Plastics, Inc. operates from West Berlin, New Jersey, where it has provided custom plastic injection molding for over two decades. The company describes itself as offering the personal service of a "mom and pop" operation, though no founding year or founder names are disclosed in its public materials.

