UPDATE companies SET description='Eastman Screen Printing was founded in 2022 in Concord, New Hampshire, as a locally owned shop. The venture began as a long-held dream of managers Ron Dulong and Sam Mostue, who envisioned a neighborhood screen-printing service where customers could watch their promotional products being crafted by hand, much like a local candy shop.

The company provides screen printing on apparel and tote bags using plastisol, water-based, and discharge inks; embroidery with digitizing, 3D foam, and puff styles; signs, banners, and vehicle graphics printed on vinyl; and business printing including cards, brochures, flyers, and direct-mail services such as EDDM. All production is done in-house, with order volumes ranging from a single piece to over 10,000 units and rush turnaround available.

Eastman serves businesses and organizations throughout Concord and central New Hampshire. Clients include local companies such as Out on a Limb Tree Care LLC, school theatre programs, and corporate customers needing uniforms, event gear, and promotional items. The shop also handles retail-style orders for individuals and small groups.

The founders emphasize transparent, in-house production that lets clients see the work in progress, full-service support from design through delivery, and personalized service with upfront pricing. Their stated goal is to make Concord a more creative community by offering a friendly, capable local alternative for custom printing and branding.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen printing (plastisol, water-based, discharge inks)", "Embroidery (digitizing, 3D foam, puff)", "Vinyl banner and sign printing", "Vehicle graphics and wraps", "Business card, brochure, flyer, postcard, letterhead printing", "Every Door Direct Mail (EDDM) and mailing list preparation", "Graphic design and art preparation", "Heat transfer printing"], "industries": ["Local businesses (Concord & Central NH)", "Schools and educational programs", "Landscaping and tree care", "Corporate and promotional products", "Event and team apparel"], "materials": ["Plastisol ink", "Water-based ink", "Discharge ink", "Vinyl", "Paper and cardstock"], "equipment": [], "volume": "1 to 10,000+ units", "lead_time": "Rush capabilities available; fast turnaround", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house production for speed, quality, and control", "Full-service from design prep to delivery", "Personalized support with transparent pricing", "Proudly serving Concord & Central NH", "Orders from 1 to 10,000+ with rush capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2022 -> db", "Headquarters: Concord, New Hampshire -> db", "Locally owned -> /", "Managers: Ron Dulong and Sam Mostue -> /, /services", "Screen printing with plastisol, water-based, discharge inks -> /services", "Embroidery with digitizing, 3D foam, puff -> /services", "Signs, banners, vehicle graphics (vinyl) -> /services", "Business printing (cards, brochures, flyers, letterhead) -> /services", "Direct mail services (EDDM, mailing list prep) -> /services", "In-house production, rush capabilities -> /services", "Order volume 1 to 10