UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1919 in Casper, Wyoming, Eaton Sales & Service traces its origins to the Eaton Metal Products Company, which was active in petroleum equipment as early as the 1950s. The business re‑entered the petroleum market in the 1980s through a series of acquisitions and internal growth, expanding into a full‑service sales, installation, and service operation across the Rocky Mountain region.

The company manufactures both above‑ground and underground fuel storage tanks and provides a complete range of petroleum equipment services, including sales, installation, construction, fueling‑system maintenance, lubrication, mechanical‑integrity inspection, and distribution. It operates from nine locations spanning Colorado, Utah, Wyoming, New Mexico, and Arizona, and reports more than 500,000 completed projects and 30,000 active customers.

Eaton serves retail and commercial fueling stations, agricultural operations, marinas, and aviation facilities. Its customer base includes major oil companies, big‑box retailers, grocery‑store chains, and independent fueling operators throughout the Rocky Mountain region.

The firm emphasizes 24/7 emergency response, a team of factory‑ and regulatory‑certified technicians trained on equipment from suppliers such as Wayne, Veeder‑Root, OPW, and Franklin, and an engineering group that supports custom tank design. Its stated mission is to exceed customer expectations with responsive, cost‑effective manufacturing and service solutions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Tank Manufacturing", "Above Ground Tank Manufacturing", "Underground Tank Manufacturing", "Petroleum Equipment Sales", "Petroleum Equipment Service", "Installation", "Construction", "Fueling System Services", "Lubrication Services", "Mechanical Integrity Inspection", "Distribution Services", "24/7 Emergency Service", "Technician Training and Certification", "Custom Tank Engineering"], "industries": ["Retail Fueling Stations", "Commercial Fueling Stations", "Agricultural Operations", "Marinas", "Aviation", "Major Oil Companies", "Big Box Retailers", "Grocery Store Chains", "Independent Retail/Commercial Fueling Facilities"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 emergency service across nine Rocky Mountain locations", "Over 100 years of tank manufacturing experience", "Factory\u2011 and regulatory\u2011certified technicians trained on major supplier equipment", "Engineering team supporting custom above\u2011ground and underground tank design", "Buying power from century\u2011long manufacturer relationships"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1919 -> db", "Headquarters in Casper, Wyoming -> db", "Nine locations across Colorado, Utah, Wyoming, New Mexico, Arizona -> home page", "Manufactures above\u2011ground and underground fuel storage tanks -> home page", "Provides petroleum equipment sales, service, installation, construction, fueling\u2011system maintenance, lubrication, mechanical\u2011integrity inspection, distribution -> home page", "Serves retail/commercial fueling stations, agricult