UPDATE companies SET description='Eckhart Woodworking is a family-owned custom woodworking shop based in Monroe, Indiana, founded in 1989. The company began as a family operation rooted in Amish construction expertise, blending traditional craftsmanship with modern technology.

The shop specializes in custom molding (offering over 1,200 profiles), interior and exterior doors, gun cabinets, restaurant and bar interiors, live-edge conference tables, merchant display units, and modern design furniture.

Customers range from homeowners seeking restoration trim matches and custom entry doors to hospitality contractors outfitting restaurants and bars, retailers needing display fixtures, and corporate clients ordering conference tables. The company also serves firearm enthusiasts with custom gun cabinets and handles historical restoration work.

