UPDATE companies SET description='Edge Plastics, Inc. operates from Mansfield, Ohio, where it was founded in 1975 by Marilyn and David Eckstein as D&M Plastics. The family-owned business was purchased in 2005 by Shelley Fisher, an Ohio State University MBA graduate, who expanded the operation while maintaining its founding principles.

