UPDATE companies SET description='El Capitan Foods operates from Indianapolis, Indiana, where it was founded by two food enthusiasts as a family-owned business. The company began with a focus on authentic Mexican-style corn tortillas and has since expanded into rice-based alternatives and snack products.

