UPDATE companies SET description='Electronic Engineering Co. has operated from Des Moines, Iowa since 1946, building a presence as a wireless communications, data, and security solutions provider across Iowa and Nebraska.

The firm delivers a full lifecycle of technical services including system engineering, project management, installation, equipment repair, FCC licensing, tower construction, and ongoing maintenance. Its portfolio spans two-way radio systems (as an authorized Motorola Solutions dealer), data communications, video security, fleet tracking (via Geotab), in-building coverage, vehicle upfitting (as a Federal Signal authorized service center), and dispatch solutions. The company also manages wireless networks through its system management offering.

Electronic Engineering serves public safety agencies, enterprise customers, and fleet operators. Its public safety solutions unify voice, video, and data on a common platform, while its industry solutions address voice and multimedia collaboration needs for a range of commercial and government clients. Fleet solutions target organizations seeking vehicle tracking, upfitting, and in-vehicle video.

The company emphasizes a collaborative, team-based approach with customers, stating that collaboration between the client and its technical staff guarantees a successful outcome. Its mission centers on providing goods and services that make customers’ lives safer, more efficient, and enjoyable, leveraging nearly 75 years of experience and partnerships with Motorola Solutions, Genetec, and Federal Signal.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Consulting & Engineering", "Two-Way Radio Solutions", "Data Communications Solutions", "Video Security Solutions", "Fleet Solutions", "System Management", "Installation", "Equipment Repair", "FCC Licensing", "Tower Construction", "Maintenance", "Vehicle Upfitting", "In-Building Solutions", "Radio Dispatch Solutions", "GPS Tracking", "System Engineering", "Project Management"], "industries": ["Public Safety Solutions", "Industry Solutions"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 75 years of experience in wireless communications", "Authorized Motorola Solutions dealer and ecosystem partner", "Federal Signal authorized service center for vehicle upfitting", "Comprehensive lifecycle support from design through maintenance", "Extensive service coverage across Iowa and Nebraska"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1946 -> homepage", "Headquarters Des Moines, Iowa -> db", "Services include system engineering, installation, repair, FCC licensing, tower construction, maintenance -> homepage", "Authorized Motorola Solutions dealer -> homepage", "Federal Signal authorized service center for vehicle upfitting -> homepage", "Public Safety Solutions offered -> homepage", "Industry Solutions offered -> homepage", "Geotab fleet tracking partner -> homepage", "Genetec access control partner -> homepage", "Team-based collaborative approach -> /about-us", "Mission to make customers'' lives safer, more efficient, enjoyable -> homepage"], "company_type": "Installer / se