Electronics Expo emphasizes its status as an authorized dealer guaranteeing 100-percent genuine products with full manufacturer warranties, free shipping on all orders, and expert support available by phone. The combination of a broad curated catalog, in-house design and installation teams, and a dedicated trade program is presented as its core differentiation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Home theater design", "Professional audio/video installation", "Smart home integration", "Car audio installation", "Retail sales of consumer electronics", "Trade partner / B2B sourcing program"], "industries": ["Consumer electronics", "Home theater", "Car audio", "Professional audio", "Smart home"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Authorized dealer for 500+ brands with full manufacturer warranty", "Free shipping on all orders", "In-house custom home theater design and professional installation", "Car audio installation services", "Trade Partner Program for B2B integrators and installers"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2003 -> db", "Headquarters Wayne, New Jersey -> db", "Authorized dealer for 500+ brands -> homepage", "196K+ happy customers, 23+ years experience -> homepage", "Custom home theater design and installation services -> homepage", "Car installation services -> homepage", "Free shipping on all orders -> homepage", "Trade Partner Program -> homepage", "Social media: Facebook, Instagram, TikTok -> homepage footer"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Authorized Dealer For Top Brands ... 500+ Brands Available ... Shop By Category ... Home Audio, TVs & Projectors, Car Audio, Pro Audio", "founded_year": "2003", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='electronics-expo' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Elemental Energy is a locally owned and operated solar design and installation firm based in Portland, Oregon. Founded in 2010 by graduates of the first accredited Bachelor of Science program in Renewable Energy Engineering, the company began with a mission to critically address how society uses and thinks about energy.

The company provides residential and commercial photovoltaic system design and installation, custom battery storage and backup systems, Tesla Powerwall installation, and licensed electrical services for residential, commercial, and industrial projects. With an in-house team of 55 employees, Elemental Energy has completed over 4,000 installations totaling more than 50 megawatts across Oregon and southern Washington.

Its customers include homeowners and businesses throughout Oregon and Washington, as well as mobile system installations. The firm also partners with Twende Solar to deliver renewable energy to communities without electricity access in South America, Central America, Africa, and Asia.

Elemental Energy emphasizes a humanitarian outlook and passion for clean energy, aiming to help clients achieve energy independence and realize the benefits of their financial investments. The company holds NABCEP certification for installers and technical sales professionals, is a Tesla Powerwall Certified Installer, and maintains Oregon and Washington contractor licenses.', certifications=ARRAY['OR CCB 195141','OR Electrical License C1228','WA CCB #ELEMEEL823D1','Energy Trust of Oregon Trade Ally','Tesla Powerwall Certified Installer']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential solar PV design and installation", "Commercial solar PV and energy storage design and installation", "Custom battery storage and backup system design and installation", "Tesla Powerwall installation", "Residential, commercial, and industrial electrical repairs, upgrades, and installations", "Charitable solar installations via Twende Solar partnership"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Mobile systems", "International development (non-profit)"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Tesla Powerwall", "Enphase (Premium Installer)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house team handles every project from start to finish", "Locally owned and operated in the Pacific Northwest since 2010", "Tesla Powerwall Certified Installer", "NABCEP Certified Installer and Technical Sales Professional", "Over 4,000 installations and 50 MW deployed"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2010 -> db", "Headquarters Portland, Oregon -> db", "55 employees -> page ''/''", "4,000 installations -> page ''/''", "50 MW installed -> page ''/''", "Locally owned & operated -> page ''/''", "Founded by graduates of Renewable Energy Engineering program -> page ''/about-us''", "NABCEP Certified Installer & Technical Sales Professional -> page ''/about-us''", "Tesla Powerwall Certified Installer -> page ''/services''", "OR CCB 195141 -> page ''/''", "OR Electrical License C1228 -