UPDATE companies SET description='Elite Woodworking was founded in 1990 in Phoenix, Arizona, by Dan Walker after he completed an apprenticeship at Wilson Custom Cabinets in 1982 and worked for a small custom cabinet shop for two additional years. The company remains family-owned and operated from its facility, where it moved in 1999 after initially renting space within an existing cabinet shop.

