UPDATE companies SET description='Engineered Plastic Components (EPC Manufacturing) is headquartered in Lebanon, Kentucky, and operates a network of 21 manufacturing facilities across the United States, Canada, and Mexico. The company serves as a Tier 1 supplier to automotive OEMs and provides molded components for appliance, medical device, and consumer product manufacturers.

The company specializes in injection molding with press capacities ranging from 25 to 4,400 tons, offering two-shot molding, overmolding, insert molding, gas assist, and in-mold decoration. Secondary operations include sonic, hot plate, spin, and vibration welding; pad printing, silk screening, hot stamping, and heat transfer; as well as interior and exterior painting, powder coating, and full assembly and sub-assembly. Facilities such as the 250,000-square-foot Lebanon, Kentucky plant run 24/7, while the Osceola, Wisconsin site maintains ISO 13485 certification and IQ/OQ/PQ validations for medical device packaging.

EPC supplies complex instrument panel assemblies, center consoles, door panels, and painted exterior trim to automotive manufacturers. For the appliance sector it produces control panels, structural housings, and components with heat resistance and UV stability. Medical customers receive precision housings for diagnostic equipment and surgical instrument components manufactured in FDA-compliant cleanrooms. Consumer product lines include electronic device housings and appliance parts made with recycled materials where specified.

The company emphasizes its North American footprint, 24/7 production capability, and integrated quality systems—including IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and ISO 13485 certifications across multiple sites—as key differentiators for supply chain reliability and regulatory compliance.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 13485','ISO 14001','IATF 16949']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding (25-4,400 ton)", "Two-shot molding", "Overmolding", "Insert molding", "Gas assist molding", "In-mold decoration", "Assembly and sub-assembly", "Sonic welding", "Hot plate welding", "Spin welding", "Vibration welding", "Pad printing", "Silk screening", "Hot stamping", "Heat transfer", "Heat staking", "Interior painting", "Exterior painting", "Powder coating", "Leak testing", "Metrology (CMM, Vision, DSC)", "Mold repair and manufacturing", "Tooling support", "SPC monitoring", "IQ/OQ/PQ validation", "Device packaging", "Cleanroom manufacturing (ISO 13485)"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Appliances", "Medical Devices", "Consumer Products"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CMM, Vision, DSC metrology equipment", "7 paint lines (1K/2K/Waterborne)", "Metal stamping presses", "Injection molding presses (25-4,400 ton)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["21 strategically located facilities across North America", "24/7 production capability at multiple sites", "IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and ISO 13485 certifications", "Integrated molding, decoration, welding, painting, and assembly under one roof", "Certified Minority Supplier at Osceola, Wisconsin facility"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Lebanon, Kentucky -> db", "21 facilities across 3 countries -> /", "Certifications: ISO 9001, ISO 13485, ISO 14001, IATF 16949 -> db, /", "Injection molding range 25-4,400 ton -> /", "Two-shot, overmolding, insert molding, gas assist, in-mold decoration -> /", "Secondary operations: welding, printing, painting, assembly -> /", "Facility details (Leba